{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/72968ee22ef0a025347f50dd1a298f2f.avif?t=1765941223\" width=506 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The evil necromancer Bobo</strong> is constructing a Big Tower to Heaven to harness it's power and conquer The Realm! Can the creatures of The Realm stop Bobo before its too late?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins as Bibi</strong>, the hopeful, fluffy, and surprisingly purple adventurer! Each character you unlock has their own reason for conquering <i>Bobo's Big Tower</i>. Try to beat the final boss of each story line to piece together the full history of the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.poster.avif?t=1765941223\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.webm?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/2746dd65bc06444cc21f819327697563.avif?t=1765941223\" width=506 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bobo's Big Tower</strong></i><strong> is an action-puzzle game</strong> in a style inspired by the GameBoy Color! Choose from a colorful cast of characters and solve procedurally-generated floors of puzzles to survive the onslaught of Bobo's minions blocking your path! <strong>Time only moves when you do</strong>, so be sure to strategize critically before each move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.poster.avif?t=1765941223\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.webm?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifiers provide many combinations</strong> of interesting &amp; game-changing challenges to spice up your runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/b6afaa184d5180431023fd7624e71319.avif?t=1765941223\" width=852 height=852 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Every character has their own starter items</strong> and weapon pools to work with throughout each run. Weapons can increase your range, deal physical or magic damage, launch projectiles, and/or even be upgraded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/473b49fa03e664d2b1dfd2106116bf7d.poster.avif?t=1765941223\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/473b49fa03e664d2b1dfd2106116bf7d.webm?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/473b49fa03e664d2b1dfd2106116bf7d.mp4?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to collect artifacts</strong> along the way to build synergy with your weapons and play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.poster.avif?t=1765941223\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.webm?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/e1c4db90949e4d475fd5702de17dba60.mp4?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what kinds of challenges await you in the tower?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.poster.avif?t=1765941223\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.webm?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/22e277c3885f8d4d7bdc78cee7b12d67.mp4?t=1765941223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/9b4c844fa6702592c61a9c38ba3d76c1.avif?t=1765941223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras_big/9b4c844fa6702592c61a9c38ba3d76c1.webp?t=1765941223 width=1560 height=2340 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729890?t=1765941223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/ba0ce70523a0f1d8a046ff6e0521dfd79fba4698/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765941223","capsule_i